{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation Protocol</strong> is a first-person surveillance horror game. Monitor live camera feeds, detect and report supernatural anomalies, and survive an escalating threat from a malevolent entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You an operator of a clandestine surveillance system. Your mission is simple: identify and report anomalies as they occur. Objects shift when no one\u2019s watching. When you spot an anomaly, report it via the Report Anomaly interface. Mind your entries - <i>the Director does not forgive errors.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Surveillance Horror Gameplay:</i> A tense loop of watching, spotting, and reporting anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Psychological Horror</i> <i>Atmosphere:</i> Unnerving audio cues, shifting environments, and constant paranoia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Multiple Anomaly Types:</i> Objects moving, rooms distorting, figures appearing \u2014 each with unique behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Replay-ability:</i> Randomized anomaly patterns ensure no two sessions feel the same. Over a dozen unique anomaly types.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052400?t=1762290882","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052400?t=1762290882","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/829006df6104af3d612bb5d652764fe595e85f29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762290882","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052400/829006df6104af3d612bb5d652764fe595e85f29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762290882","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids